db72d50-e812-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4r3s86.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lh4r3s85/39113a58-98f9-4cce-bcf7-ba9761164699/6db72d50-e812-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4r3s86.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lh4r3s85/39113a58-98f9-4cce-bcf7-ba9761164699/6db72d50-e812-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4r3s86.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lh4r3s85/39113a58-98f9-4cce-bcf7-ba9761164699/6db72d50-e812-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4r3s86.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lh4r3s85/39113a58-98f9-4cce-bcf7-ba9761164699/6db72d50-e812-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4r3s86.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">\n<br><br>This product can exist in 2\nconformations, E and Z.\n<br><br><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lh4rm8vw/f69a5079-106b-4f8b-a5e6-1ec6824c0f8e/6f2662d0-e814-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rm8vx.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lh4rm8vw/f69a5079-106b-4f8b-a5e6-1ec6824c0f8e/6f2662d0-e814-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rm8vx.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Hydrocarbons Question 16 English Explanation 5\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lh4rm8vw/f69a5079-106b-4f8b-a5e6-1ec6824c0f8e/6f2662d0-e814-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rm8vx.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lh4rm8vw/f69a5079-106b-4f8b-a5e6-1ec6824c0f8e/6f2662d0-e814-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rm8vx.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lh4rm8vw/f69a5079-106b-4f8b-a5e6-1ec6824c0f8e/6f2662d0-e814-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rm8vx.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1