, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lh4rc1at/91c0d433-1dcf-43e1-ba4d-49811fe610dc/5332bc50-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rc1au.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\">\n<br><br>Since, the groups about sp<sup>2</sup>\n hybridised carbon\nof cyclopentane is fixed no E and Z forms\nare possible. This molecule has only one\nconformation.\n<br><br>(c) Elimination of H<sub>3</sub> proton :\n<br><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rh9o6.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rh9o6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Hydrocarbons Question 16 English Explanation 7\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rh9o6.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rh9o6.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rh9o6.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rh9o6.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544f78/file-1lh4rh9o6.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1lh4rh9o5/0dc336ac-0f3d-469f-8180-f0c95f74ed50/e4b5b650-e813-11ed-a20e-7175d6544